---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../data/site.js";
const updated = "August 2026";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Notice and Your Data Rights | Kool Konsulting"
  description="What personal data Kool Konsulting collects through this website, why we collect it, how long we keep it, and your rights under India's DPDP Act 2023 explained."
  path="/privacy"
  ogSlug="privacy"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Privacy", href: "/privacy" }]}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap legal">
      <p class="label label-accent">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="t-display" style="margin-top:1rem;">Privacy notice</h1>
      <p class="form-note" style="margin-top:0.75rem;">Last updated {updated}</p>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
        <p>
          This notice explains what personal data {SITE.name} collects through this
          website, why we collect it and what we do with it. It is written to meet
          India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act 2023.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-title">Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          {SITE.name}, a consulting practice based in {SITE.address.locality},
          {" "}{SITE.address.region}, India, is the data fiduciary for the personal
          data described here. Contact us about anything on this page at
          {" "}<a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-title">What we collect, and why</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>When you send an enquiry.</strong> Your name, email address, and
          optionally your phone number, business name, the service you are interested
          in, your timeline and what you describe as the problem. We collect this only
          to answer your enquiry and, if it leads somewhere, to carry out the work.
          The lawful basis is your consent, given by submitting the form.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>When you request a scorecard.</strong> Your business name, city and
          email address, used only to prepare and send that assessment.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>When you browse.</strong> If website analytics are enabled we use
          Plausible Analytics, which is cookie-free, collects no personal data and
          does not track you across sites. There is no advertising pixel on this site
          and we do not build visitor profiles.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-title">Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This site sets no tracking or advertising cookies, which is why you have not
          been shown a consent banner. Your browser stores one small item locally —
          the time of your last form submission — purely to stop the same enquiry
          being sent repeatedly. It never leaves your device and we cannot read it.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-title">Who else sees your data</h2>
        <p>
          Form submissions are processed by Netlify, which hosts this site, and
          delivered to our email. If you book a call, that booking is handled by
          Cal.com. Each holds your data only to provide that service. We do not sell
          personal data, and we do not share it for anyone else's marketing.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-title">How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          Enquiries that do not become work are deleted within twelve months. Records
          relating to actual engagements are kept for eight years, as Indian tax and
          contractual record-keeping requires. Scorecard requests are deleted within
          six months.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-title">Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Under the DPDP Act you may ask us for a copy of the personal data we hold
          about you, ask us to correct anything inaccurate, ask us to erase it, and
          withdraw consent at any time. Write to
          {" "}<a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> and we will respond
          within thirty days. If you are not satisfied with our response you may
          complain to the Data Protection Board of India.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-title">Children</h2>
        <p>
          This site is intended for business owners and is not directed at anyone
          under 18. We do not knowingly collect data from children.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-title">Changes</h2>
        <p>
          If this notice changes materially we will update the date at the top and,
          where the change affects data we already hold about you, contact you
          directly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { max-width: 46rem; }
  .legal .prose h2 { margin: 2.5rem 0 0.9rem; }
  .legal .prose a { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
